worker_module_budget
  module "formal_ai_worker_18.js"
  ceiling 1164
  rationale "Part of the mechanically split browser mirror of the Rust solver: issue #658 divided one oversized worker file by line count, so this shard has no subject of its own. Its ceiling falls as its logic moves into js/wasm-worker. Ceiling moved 1185 to 1191 when plan 10 L20 retired conversational phrase families onto declared roles. Lowered to 1164 for issue #918 (2026-10-08): the fetch, navigation and frame-policy wording and the Wikinews fallback description are seeded web_* responses (data/seed/multilingual-responses-synthesis.lino), which the native url_navigate row renders too."
